 aware benchmarks\, and consistency of simulated trajectories.\nAdditional
  topics: System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\, Robustness & Safe
 ty\nScope sources (2026): https://fmts-workshop.github.io/cfp.html\nScope
  last checked: 2026-10-07
