 : System Identification & Data-driven Dynamics\, Control & Robotics\, Tim
 e Series & Sequential Data\, Machine Learning\nSize: M\nSubmission type: 
 Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-06\nNotes:
  Triennial TC 1.1 symposium. Regular papers\, joint journal papers\, and 
 dissemination/discussion routes have distinct requirements\; consult the 
 call. Published deadline days are confirmed but cutoff hours use estimate
 d end-of-day AoE. Size is an editorial category.\nScope: System identific
 ation and data-driven modeling for dynamical systems and control. Charact
 eristic themes include nonlinear identification\, model reduction\, ident
