 dynamical models\, rather than becoming general-purpose domain conference
 s.\nAdditional topics: Nonlinear Dynamics & Chaos\, Complex Systems & Net
 work Science\nScope sources (2027): https://conferences.ifac-control.org/
 sysid2027/participate/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
